<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Glynhill shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Glynhill shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of hotel management and property concern Glynhill International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Glynhill shares rose HK$0.05 or 9.26 percent to end Tuesday at HK$0.59 with 11.13 million shares traded.</p>
<p>The company is a subsidiary of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
